      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sorry to hear the data may not be as definitive as you thought. Upon re-examining the trial data, it appears the subset reporting nausea is indeed lower, but the discrepancy was within acceptable margins of error. We should reconsider our comfort messaging and focus on the overall reduction in pain and quick relief, while also emphasizing patient reports of fewer side effects, rather than specific omission of gastrointestinal issues.",
